{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7670893498707429641","title":"数字芯片验证工程师","description":"1.负责芯片验证平台搭建，使用SystemVerilog/UVM等语言实现芯片功能和性能验证；\r\n2.负责项目相关验证策略和验证计划制定，设计和编写验证用例并完成验证执行；\r\n3.负责覆盖率收集，开展递归验证，完成芯片设计问题的调试和修复，签收验证的完整性；\r\n4.开展芯片门级功能和时序仿真，开展芯片时序确认以期达到流片需求；\r\n5.协同软件工程师进行FPGA平台验证调试和支持芯片回片测试。","requirement":"1.微电子/通信/计算机/自动化等相关专业，硕士及以上学历；\r\n2.熟悉Verilog/SystemVerilog，有相关FPGA/ASIC开发或验证经验者优先；\r\n3.熟悉集成电路验证流程，有UVM验证方法学或脚本开发经验者优先；\r\n4.良好的团队合作意识和沟通能力。","city_info":{"code":"CT_22","name":"成都","en_name":"Chengdu","i18n_name":"成都"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1786019101764,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7659311908839262514","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘计划","i18n":"2027届校园招聘计划"},"limit_count":2,"active_status":1},"job_function":{"id":"7178830559051874412","name":"硬件研发类","en_name":"Hardware R\u0026D","i18n_name":"硬件研发类"},"job_id":"7670893498707282185","city_list":[{"code":"CT_22","name":"成都","en_name":"Chengdu","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"成都","py_name":"chengdu","mdm_code":"MDCY00000342","node_status":1},{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_name":"beijing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000001","node_status":1},{"code":"CT_155","name":"西安","en_name":"Xi'an","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"西安","py_name":"xian","mdm_code":"MDCY00000395","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[]